<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse closes almost unchanged.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse closes almost unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange on Friday closed almost unchanged in slightly higher trade, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The market's 30-share index closed at 617.38 from 617.20 on Thursday.</p>
<p>Trade volume was 452,087 dinars against 433,843 dinars.</p>
<p>Chemical detergents firm SPCD was down 0.52 dinar to 54.5 dinars.</p>
<p>($=0.96 dinar)</p>
</text>
